```elixir
/// status:[DRAFT] ver:[1.0.0] created:[26.03.13]
/// doc:[PARTIAL] modified:[26.03.13] auth:[3OX.AI]
/// Box-aliveness equation — state and aliveness invariant for 3ox
```

─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
BOX-ALIVENESS EQUATION — Refined for 3ox
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

Pulse(t)   ≔ Δt → εt → σt
Tape(t)    ≔ ρt → μt
Warden(t)  ≔ Verify(Pulse(t), Tape(t))
Box₃(t)    ≔ ⟨Pulse(t), Tape(t), Warden(t)⟩

ValidBox₃(t) ≔ I[Pulse(t)]·I[Tape(t)]·I[Warden(t)] = 1
Authoritative(t) ≔ I[CanonSource(t)]·ValidBox₃(t) = 1
Success(t) ≔ Authoritative(t)·I[Goal(t)=reached] = 1
Repeatable(C) ≔ ∀t ∈ Runs(C), ValidBox₃(t)=1 under same law

─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
REFINEMENTS
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

I[x] ≔ indicator: 1 if x passes structural + hash check, else 0
I[x] ≔ (structure_valid(x) ∧ hash_chain_valid(x)) ? 1 : 0

CanonSource(t) ≔ cube root + _meta contract present
CanonSource(t) ≔ path(.3ox) ∧ exists(_meta/WHOAMI.md) ∧ exists(_meta/SESSION.CHECKPOINT.toml)

Goal(t)=reached ≔ route completed with receipt
Goal(t)=reached ≔ ∃r ∈ Tape(t) : r.status=COMPLETE ∧ r.intent=route(t).intent

─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
3OX MAPPING
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

Pulse  → (6)Pulse: run.rb, 3ox.log, receipts/
Tape   → vec3/var/receipts/, event stream, merkle.root
Warden → limits.toml, write_policy, validate at commit

:: ∎
